        "description": "1880\u20131930: page that links to the microfilm reel/frames for this ED. Open the URL in a browser (it's a JavaScript page). For 1940/1950 use `census/viewer1940.html` / `viewer1950.html` with the same parameters, or the NARA request below."
      },
      "response": []
